msgstr "Mametraka ny sanda lasitra."

#: templates.php view.php
msgid "Type"
msgstr "Karazana"

#: templates.php
msgid "The method the report owner should use to define this variable."
msgstr "Ny fomba tokony hampiasain'ny tompon'ny tatitra mba hamaritana ity miovaova ity."

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines the distance between two values if method \"DropDown\" has been chosen. Please ensure that this value is not set too low, because it defines indirectly the number of options the dropdown field will have. For example the following parameters: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01  will result in a select box of 10.001 options. This can cause dramatical performance issues due to a high CPU load at the clients side. Try to keep it under 1000."
msgstr "Mamaritra ny elanelana misy eo amin'ny sanda roa raha ny fomba \"DropDown\" no voafidy. Ataovy izay tsy hametrahana ity sanda ity ho ambany loatra, satria mamaritra ankolaka ny isan'ny safidy ho ao amin'ny saha midina izy. Ohatra, ireto masontsivana ireto: MAX:100, MIN:0, STEP:0.01 dia hiteraka boaty fisafidianana misy safidy 10.001. Mety hiteraka olana goavana amin'ny fampandehanana izany noho ny enta-mavesatra CPU avo lenta eo amin'ny mpikajy mpanjifa. Andramo tazonina ho latsaky ny 1000 izany."

#: templates.php
#, php-format
msgid "Metric Configuration [ edit: %s - %s ]"
msgstr "Fandrindrana metrika [ ovao: %s - %s ]"

#: templates.php
msgid "Metric Configuration [new]"
msgstr "Fandrindrana metrika [vaovao]"

#: templates.php
msgid "The explanation given to this measurand. This will be shown as legend within exports as well as a tooltip within the presentation of a report itself."
msgstr "Ny fanazavana nomena ho an'ity refy ity. Aseho ho fanazavana marika ao anatin'ny fanondranana ary ho torohevitra mipoitra ao amin'ny famelabelarana ny tatitra."

#: templates.php
msgid "Define a unique abbreviation for this measurand with max. 8 letters/numbers."
msgstr "Farito ny fanafohezana tokana ho an'ity zavatra refesina ity izay manana litera/isa 8 raha be indrindra."

#: templates.php
msgid "The unit given to this measurand. e.g. 'Bits/s'"
msgstr "Ny singa nomena ity refy ity. ohatra: 'Bits/s'"

#: templates.php
msgid "Consolidation function"
msgstr "Asa fanakambanana"

#: templates.php
msgid "The name of the consolidation function to define which CDPs should be read out."
msgstr "Ny anaran'ny fiasa fanamafisana mba hamaritana hoe iza amin'ireo CDP no tokony hovakiana."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand should be become part of the final report output. Leave it unflagged if this measurands will only be used as an auxiliary calculation."
msgstr "Safidio ny 'mavitrika' raha tokony ho tafiditra ao amin'ny vokatry ny tatitra farany ity sanda refesina ity. Avelao tsy voamarika raha ampiasaina ho kajy fanampiny ihany ity sanda refesina ity."

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose 'enable' if this measurand will only have one result in total instead of one for every Data Source Item. It's result<br>will be shown separately. Use this option in combination with \"Visible\" = \"off\" if you are looking for a measurand keeping an interim result only that should be reused within the calculation of other measurands without being visible for end users."
msgstr "Safidio ny 'mavitrika' raha tsy manana afa-tsy vokatra iray manontolo ity sanda refesina ity fa tsy iray isaky ny singa Loharanon'angona. Ny vokany<br>dia haseho mitokana. Ampiasao miaraka amin'ny \"Visible\" = \"off\" ity safidy ity raha mitady sanda refesina mitahiry vokatra vonjimaika ihany ianao izay tokony hampiasaina indray ao amin'ny kajin'ny sanda refesina hafa nefa tsy hita amin'ny mpampiasa farany."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formatting"
msgstr "Fandrafetana endrika"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines as what type the data should be treated as."
msgstr "Mamaritra hoe karazana inona no tokony handraisana ny angona."

#: templates.php
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "Fahamarinana"

#: templates.php
msgid "Defines how many decimal digits should be displayed for floating-point numbers."
msgstr "Mamaritra hoe firy ny isa desimaly tokony haseho ho an'ny isa misy faingo."

#: templates.php
msgid "Prefixes"
msgstr "Tovona"

#: templates.php
msgid "Choose the type of prefix being used to format the result. With the use of decimal prefixes '1024' will be formatted to '1.024k' while the binary prefixes option returns '1ki'. Select 'off' to display the raw data, here '1024'."
msgstr "Safidio ny karazana tovona ampiasaina handrafetana ny valiny. Amin'ny fampiasana tovona desimaly dia harafitra ho '1.024k' ny '1024', fa ny safidy tovona binera kosa dia mamerina '1ki'. Safidio ny 'off' mba hampisehoana ny angona tsy voarafitra, eto dia '1024'."

#: templates.php
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "Raikipohy"

#: templates.php
msgid "The mathematical definition of this measurand. Allowed are all combinations of operators and operands listed below following the rules of mathematics. Use round and square brackets to signify complex terms and the order of operations."
msgstr "Ny famaritana matematika an'ity refy ity. Azo ekena avokoa ny fitambaran'ny mpandraharaha sy ny zavatra karakaraina voatanisa eto ambany araka ny fitsipiky ny matematika. Mampiasà fonon-teny boribory sy efajoro mba hanondroana teny sarotra sy ny filaharan'ny kajy."

#: templates.php
msgid "Operators & Operands"
msgstr "Mpikajy sy voakajy"

#: templates.php
msgid "Click on one of the listed operators or operand to append them to your calucalion formula. The tooltip will show you additional information like description, return value, arguments and usage."
msgstr "Tsindrio ny iray amin'ireo mpandraharaha na sanda voatanisa mba hanampiana azy amin'ny raikipohy kajinao. Ny torohevitra miseho dia haneho anao fampahalalana fanampiny toy ny famaritana, ny sanda averina, ny singa ampidirina ary ny fampiasana."

